msgstr "Spørgsmål og svar om artikel 50 (Europa-Kommissionen)"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:75
msgid "Code of Practice on labeling AI-generated content"
msgstr "Praksiskodeks for mærkning af AI-genereret indhold"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:82
msgid "The EU icons to download"
msgstr "EU-ikonerne til download"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:86
msgid "AI Act in the Official Journal (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689)"
msgstr "AI-forordningen i EU-Tidende (forordning (EU) 2024/1689)"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:93
msgid "AI Act Service Desk"
msgstr "AI Act Service Desk"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:109
msgid "AI Act, Article 50"
msgstr "AI-forordningen, artikel 50"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:112
msgid "Since 2 August 2026, what AI made has to be visible."
msgstr "Siden 2. august 2026 skal det være synligt, hvad AI har lavet."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:118
msgid ""
"A business that publishes images, videos or recordings that look real but "
"were created or modified with AI has to label them – visibly, at the latest "
"at first sight. The duty is yours as the site owner, not the AI tool "
"maker's."
msgstr ""
"En virksomhed, der udgiver billeder, videoer eller optagelser, som ser ægte "
"ud, men er skabt eller ændret med AI, skal mærke dem – synligt, senest ved "
"første øjekast. Pligten er din som ejer af webstedet, ikke AI-værktøjets "
"producents."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:136
msgid "You have to label"
msgstr "Du skal mærke"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:139
msgid ""
"Deepfakes: AI images, videos, audio that show real or plausible people, "
"things, places or events and look real – also an invented but photorealistic"
" person."
msgstr ""
"Deepfakes: AI-billeder, -videoer og -lyd, der viser virkelige eller "
"plausible personer, ting, steder eller begivenheder og ser ægte ud – også en"
" opdigtet, men fotorealistisk person."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:145
msgid ""
"AI texts that inform the public on matters of public interest – unless a "
"person reviewed them and takes responsibility."
msgstr ""
"AI-tekster, der informerer offentligheden om emner af offentlig interesse – "
"medmindre en person har gennemgået dem og tager ansvaret."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:151
msgid ""
"Whether you meant to deceive does not matter. What your audience believes "
"counts."
msgstr ""
"Om du ville bedrage, er uden betydning. Det, dit publikum tror, tæller."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:162
msgid "No label needed for"
msgstr "Ingen mærkning nødvendig for"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:165
msgid ""
"Ordinary editing: crop, light, color, noise, dust, upscaling – also with AI "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"Almindelig redigering: beskæring, lys, farve, støj, støv, opskalering – også"
" med AI-værktøjer."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:171
msgid ""
"Obviously artificial images (illustration, comic, abstract): voluntary, but "
"good for trust."
msgstr ""
"Tydeligt kunstige billeder (illustration, tegneserie, abstrakt): frivilligt,"
" men godt for tilliden."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:177
msgid "Content created before 2 August 2026 – nothing applies retroactively."
msgstr ""
"Indhold skabt før 2. august 2026 – intet gælder med tilbagevirkende kraft."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:183
msgid ""
"Art, satire, fiction: yes, but so that the work does not suffer (e.g. in the"
" caption)."
msgstr ""
"Kunst, satire, fiktion: ja, men så værket ikke lider under det (f.eks. i "
"billedteksten)."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:194
msgid "Where the label goes"
msgstr "Hvor mærkningen skal sidde"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:197
msgid ""
"On or right at the content, visible without a click – not only in the "
"imprint."
msgstr ""
"På eller lige ved indholdet, synligt uden klik – ikke kun i kolofonen."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:203
msgid ""
"Plain words: “AI-generated”, “Modified with AI”. For screen readers as the "
"icon's name, never instead of the alt text."
msgstr ""
"Klare ord: „AI-genereret“, „Ændret med AI“. For skærmlæsere som ikonets "
"navn, aldrig i stedet for alt-teksten."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:209
msgid ""
"Videos: in a corner the whole time. Audio: at the player and in the artwork."
msgstr "Videoer: i et hjørne hele tiden. Lyd: ved afspilleren og i coveret."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:215
msgid "The AI tool's watermark or metadata does not count for you."
msgstr "AI-værktøjets vandmærke eller metadata tæller ikke for dig."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:225
msgid "The EU's icons"
msgstr "EU's ikoner"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:226
msgid ""
"From the Commission since June 2026, free to use, no attribution. Optional –"
" an equivalent label is allowed too."
msgstr ""
"Fra Kommissionen siden juni 2026, frie at bruge, ingen kildeangivelse. "
"Valgfrit – en tilsvarende mærkning er også tilladt."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:234
msgid "AI GENERATED"
msgstr "AI-GENERERET"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:236
msgid "Fully created with AI, no human-made parts."
msgstr "Helt skabt med AI, ingen menneskeskabte dele."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:244
msgid "AI MODIFIED"
msgstr "AI-ÆNDRET"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:246
msgid "Real photo, video or recording, partly modified with AI."
msgstr "Ægte foto, video eller optagelse, delvist ændret med AI."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:255
msgctxt "name of the EU basic icon"
msgid "AI"
msgstr "AI"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:262
msgid ""
"The basic icon: with your own text, with a second layer or where space is "
"short."
msgstr ""
"Basisikonet: med din egen tekst, med et andet lag eller hvor pladsen er "
"trang."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:271
msgid "Typical cases"
msgstr "Typiske tilfælde"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:275
msgid "File"
msgstr "Fil"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:276 src/admin/Look.js:107
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "Type"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:277
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Mærkning"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:312
msgid "How the plugin recognizes AI"
msgstr "Sådan genkender pluginnet AI"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:319
msgid ""
"Many AI tools write into the file that it was made with AI: Content "
"Credentials (C2PA) from ChatGPT, Gemini, Firefly or Photoshop, the IPTC "
"value “trainedAlgorithmicMedia”, the generation data of Stable Diffusion and"
" ComfyUI. The plugin reads them on upload and with every check – on your "
"server, nothing leaves it."
msgstr ""
"Mange AI-værktøjer skriver ind i filen, at den er lavet med AI: Content "
"Credentials (C2PA) fra ChatGPT, Gemini, Firefly eller Photoshop, IPTC-"
"værdien „trainedAlgorithmicMedia“, genereringsdata fra Stable Diffusion og "
"ComfyUI. Pluginnet læser dem ved upload og ved hvert tjek – på din server, "
"intet forlader den."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:325
msgid ""
"A missing trace means nothing: screenshots, exports and image optimizers "
"remove them. That is why “Used, not decided” shows everything visible on "
"your site that has no decision yet. Only you know for sure how an image was "
"made."
msgstr ""
"Et manglende spor betyder intet: skærmbilleder, eksporter og "
"billedoptimering fjerner dem. Derfor viser „Brugt, ikke afgjort“ alt, der er"
" synligt på dit websted og endnu ikke er afgjort. Kun du ved med sikkerhed, "
"hvordan et billede er lavet."

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:333
msgid "This knowledge as a skill"
msgstr "Denne viden som skill"

#: src/admin/Knowledge.js:337
msgid ""
"The image analysis thinks with a skill: a guide to the AI Act with sources, "
"in the plugin under skills/eu-ai-act-labels. You can give the same files to "
"any AI agent that reads Agent Skills – Claude, Cursor, Codex and others."
msgstr ""
"Billedanalysen tænker med en skill: en guide til AI-forordningen med kilder,"
" i pluginnet under skills/eu-ai-act-labels. De samme filer kan du give til "
"enhver AI-agent, der læser Agent Skills – Claude, Cursor, Codex og andre."

